{"seq":1,"slug":"debates-with-zhu-xi","title":"Debates With Zhu Xi","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/controversies-and-appraisal/debates-with-zhu-xi","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-orthodoxy-question","title":"朱王之辩与正统之争","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/controversies-and-appraisal/debates-with-zhu-xi/the-orthodoxy-question","wordCount":1922,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"subjectivism-charge","title":"主观主义之疑","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/controversies-and-appraisal/debates-with-zhu-xi/subjectivism-charge","wordCount":1848,"readingTime":8}],"introHtml":"<p>本章审视&quot;朱王之辩&quot;及&quot;主观主义&quot;之疑。&quot;朱王之辩&quot;，是程朱理学与陆王心学两大流派的对峙——涉及&quot;理&quot;的根源、成圣方法的根本分歧，以及对儒学正统的争夺；王阳明心学曾因挑战正统而遭官方打压。&quot;主观主义&quot;之疑，则源于&quot;心外无物&quot;等命题——本章辨析了王阳明心学的真意，指出它高扬的是道德主体性，而非否认客观世界。本章以审慎而辩证的态度辨析这些争议。</p>\n"}